ering"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even slumbering"},{"surface":"இலர்","parts":[{"text":"இலர்","lemma":"இலர்","gloss":"they do not"}],"gloss":"they do not"},{"surface":"பிறர்","parts":[{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"பிறர்","gloss":"others"}],"gloss":"others"},{"surface":"அஞ்சுவது","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சுவது","lemma":"அஞ்சுவது","gloss":"that which is feared"}],"gloss":"that which is feared"},{"surface":"அஞ்சி","parts":[{"text":"அஞ்சு","lemma":"அஞ்சு","gloss":"fear"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having feared"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"புகழ்","parts":[{"text":"புகழ்","lemma":"புகழ்","gloss":"fame"}],"gloss":"fame"},{"surface":"எனின்","parts":[{"text":"எனின்","lemma":"எனின்","gloss":"if it is said"}],"gloss":"if it is said"},{"surface":"உயிரும்","parts":[{"text":"உயிர்","lemma":"உயிர்","gloss":"life"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even life"},{"surface":"கொடுக்குவர்","parts":[{"text":"கொடுக்குவர்","lemma":"கொடு","gloss":"they will give"}],"gloss":"they will give"},{"surface":"பழி","parts":[{"text":"பழி","lemma":"பழி","gloss":"blame"}],"gloss":"blame"},{"surface":"எனின்","parts":[{"text":"எனின்","lemma":"எனின்","gloss":"if it is said"}],"gloss":"if it is said"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"உலகு","parts":[{"text":"உலகு","lemma":"உலகு","gloss":"world"}],"gloss":"world","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"உடன்","parts":[{"text":"உடன்","lemma":"உடன்","gloss":"together with"}],"gloss":"together with"},{"surface":"பெறினும்","parts":[{"text":"பெறு","lemma":"பெறு","gloss":"receive"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"இனும்","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if they receive"},{"surface":"கொள்ளலர்","parts":[{"text":"கொள்","lemma":"கொள்","gloss":"accept"},{"text":"அலர்","lemma":"அலர்","gloss":"they will not"}],"gloss":"they will not accept"},{"surface":"அயர்விலர்","parts":[{"text":"அயர்வு","lemma":"அயர்வு","gloss":"weariness"},{"text":"இலர்","lemma":"இலர்","gloss":"they do not have"}],"gloss":"they have no weariness"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"அன்ன","parts":[{"text":"அன்ன","lemma":"அன்ன","gloss":"such"}],"gloss":"such"},{"surface":"மாட்சி","parts":[{"text":"மாட்சி","lemma":"மாட்சி","gloss":"greatness"}],"gloss":"greatness"},{"surface":"அனையர்","parts":[{"text":"அனையர்","lemma":"அனையர்","gloss":"those who are like that"}],"gloss":"those who are like that"},{"surface":"ஆகி","parts":[{"text":"ஆகு","lemma":"ஆகு","gloss":"become"},{"text":"இ","lemma":"இ","gloss":"having"}],"gloss":"having become"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"தமக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தமக்கு","lemma":"தமக்கு","gloss":"for themselves"}],"gloss":"for themselves"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"முயலா","parts":[{"text":"முயல்","lemma":"முயல்","gloss":"strive"},{"text":"ஆ","lemma":"ஆ","gloss":"not"}],"gloss":"not striving"},{"surface":"நோன்","parts":[{"text":"நோன்","lemma":"நோன்","gloss":"strong"}],"gloss":"strong"},{"surface":"தாள்","parts":[{"text":"தாள்","lemma":"தாள்","gloss":"effort"}],"gloss":"effort"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பிறர்க்கு","parts":[{"text":"பிறர்","lemma":"பிறர்","gloss":"others"},{"text":"க்கு","lemma":"க்கு","gloss":"for"}],"gloss":"for others"},{"surface":"என","parts":[{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"saying"}],"gloss":"saying"},{"surface":"முயலுநர்","parts":[{"text":"முயல்","lemma":"முயல்","gloss":"strive"},{"text":"உநர்","lemma":"உநர்","gloss":"those who do"}],"gloss":"those who strive"},{"surface":"உண்மையானே","parts":[{"text":"உண்மை","lemma":"உண்மை","gloss":"existence"},{"text":"ஆன்","lemma":"ஆன்","gloss":"by/because of"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"because of their existence indeed"}]}],"literal":"Because it exists indeed, behold, this world, if the gods' / nectar of immortality is obtained, even if it is sweet, saying, / alone, eating, they do not indeed; they have no anger; / slumbering, they do not; what others fear, fearing; / if it is fame, even life they will give; if it is blame, / even if they receive the world together with it, they will not accept; they have no weariness; / such greatness, those who are like that, having become, / for themselves, saying, not striving, with strong effort, / for others, saying, those who strive, because of their existence indeed.","translation":"Behold, this world exists because of those who, even if they were to obtain the nectar of the gods, would not eat it alone, thinking it sweet; they bear no malice; they do not slumber in laziness, but fear what others fear; they would give up their very lives for fame, but would not accept blame even if they were to gain the whole world; they are free from weariness; having attained such greatness, they do not strive for themselves, but with strong effort, they strive for others.","modern":"இந்த உலகம் நிலைபெற்றிருப்பதற்குக் காரணம், தேவர்களின் அமிழ்தமே கிடைப்பதாயினும் அது இனிமையானது என்று தனித்து உண்ணாதவர்கள்; யாரிடமும் வெறுப்புக் கொள்ளாதவர்கள்; சோம்பலின்றிச் செயல்படுபவர்கள்; பிறர் அஞ்சுவதற்குத் தாமும் அஞ்சுபவர்கள்; புகழ் கிடைக்குமென்றால் தம் உயிரையும் கொடுப்பவர்கள்; பழி வரும் என்றால் இந்த உலகம் முழுவதையும் பெற்றாலும் ஏற்றுக்கொள்ளாதவர்கள்; சோர்வில்லாதவர்கள்; இத்தகைய பெருமைகளை உடையவர்களாகி, தமக்காக உழைக்காமல், பிறருக்காகத் தம் வலிமையான முயற்சியால் உழைப்பவர்கள் இருப்பதனால்தான்.","explanation":"This poem is spoken by the poet Kadalul Mayndha Ilamperu Vazhudhi under the theme of Porunmozhi Kanchi (counseling on the path of virtue) in the Potuviyal tinai. The poet explains why the world continues to exist despite all its troubles: it is because of the presence of noble, selfless human beings. These noble people do not enjoy even the nectar of immortality alone, they bear no hatred, they do not succumb to laziness, and they fear what is truly fearful. They value honor above life itself and reject infamy even if offered the entire world. By striving tirelessly not for themselves but for the welfare of others, they sustain the world.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.4],[0.4,0.7],[0.7,1.0],[1.0,1.6],[1.6,2.0],[2.0,2.4],[2.4,3.2],[3.2,3.9],[3.9,4.5],[4.5,5.25],[5.25,5.7],[5.7,6.1],[6.1,7.1],[7.1,7.7],[7.7,7.9],[7.9,8.2],[8.2,8.7],[8.7,10.1],[10.1,10.4],[10.4,10.89],[10.89,11.3],[11.3,12.08],[12.08,12.7],[12.7,12.9],[12.9,13.9],[13.9,14.8],[14.8,15.1],[15.1,15.3],[15.3,15.7],[15.7,16.76],[16.76,17.4],[17.4,17.9],[18.76,19.46],[19.46,19.96],[19.96,20.16],[20.16,20.46]],"female":[[0.0,0.46],[0.46,0.8],[0.8,1.1],[1.1,1.8],[1.8,2.3],[2.3,2.73],[2.73,3.6],[3.6,4.5],[4.5,5.8],[5.8,6.0],[6.0,6.4],[6.4,6.8],[6.8,7.99],[7.99,8.7],[8.7,9.1],[9.1,9.5],[9.5,10.1],[10.1,11.7],[11.7,12.1],[12.1,12.7],[12.7,13.2],[13.2,13.4],[13.4,14.9],[14.9,15.2],[15.2,16.0],[16.0,16.7],[16.7,17.0],[17.0,17.2],[17.2,17.7],[17.7,18.64],[18.64,19.2],[19.2,20.0],[20.88,21.48],[21.48,21.98],[21.98,22.18],[22.18,22.48]]},"sync":[[["உண்டால்","because it exists indeed"]],[["அம்ம","behold"]],[["இவ்வுலகம்","this world"]],[["இந்திரர்","gods"]],[["அமிழ்தம்","nectar of immortality"]],[["இயைவது","that which is obtained"]],[["இயைவது","that which is obtained"],["ஆயினும்","even if it is"]],[["இனிது","sweet"],["என","saying"]],[["தமியர்","alone"]],[["உண்டலும்","even eating"]],[["இலரே","they do not indeed"]],[["முனிவிலர்","they have no anger"]],[["துஞ்சலும்","even slumbering"]],[["இலர்","they do not"]],[["பிறர்","others"]],[["அஞ்சுவது","that which is feared"]],[["அஞ்சி","having feared"]],[["புகழ்","fame"],["எனின்","if it is said"]],[["உயிரும்","even life"]],[["கொடுக்குவர்","they will give"]],[["பழி","blame"],["எனின்","if it is said"]],[["உலகு","world"],["உடன்","together with"]],[["பெறினும்","even if they receive"]],[["கொள்ளலர்","they will not accept"]],[["அயர்விலர்","they have no weariness"]],[["அன்ன","such"]],[["மாட்சி","greatness"]],[["அனையர்","those who are like that"]],[["அனையர்","those who are like that"],["ஆகி","having become"]],[["தமக்கு","for themselves"],["என","saying"]],[["முயலா","not striving"]],[["நோன்","strong"],["தாள்","effort"]],[["பிறர்க்கு","for others"],["என","saying"]],[["முயலுநர்","those who strive"]],[["உண்மையானே","because of their existence indeed"]],[["உண்மையானே","because of their existence indeed"]]]}